  "title": "Matthew E Probable NDE 6256",
  "date": "Summer of 1967",
  "content": "I was drowning and I saw my life flash before my eyes. Ever since that time, I've been really lucky at games, I've seen ghosts, I've heard my name called when there are people around, and other times no one was around. When someone calls on the phone, I'll know who it is without seeing who it is on the caller ID. I've seen strange things in the skies now for many years. I can also tell when a person is good or bad, and the same thing with buildings or even at historical sites. It's like I can feel and see at times what had happened there. I can see auras around people and other things. There are so many things have happened and still happen to this day.",
